<!--
license:CC0-1.0

Technics SX-WSA1 / SX-WSA1R floppy disks.

Sound, combination and song library disks for the WSA1 keyboard and WSA1R rack,
which share the same hardware and disks.  The WSA1 writes PC-FAT HD diskettes; the
data survives as the instrument's own files copied off real disks (no original
diskette has been dumped), so these images are faithful FAT12 reconstructions built
from those files (native data plus the .MID demo songs), which a dump of an original
could supersede.  Publishers: Technics for the factory Sound Library disks, MIDISM
(Taito Musikinstrumente GmbH) for the two third-party disks, unknown for the user sets.
-->
